.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis \- A workspace CLI for Gleam monorepos: task fan\-out, introspection, and release orchestration derived entirely from gleam.toml
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A workspace CLI for Gleam monorepos: task fan\-out, introspection, and release orchestration derived entirely from gleam.toml
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trellis\-list(1)
List members in topological order (dependencies first)
.TP
trellis\-graph(1)
Render the dependency graph
.TP
trellis\-info(1)
Show details for one package
.TP
trellis\-run(1)
Run a task across members, graph\-parallel by default
.TP
trellis\-exec(1)
Run an arbitrary command in each member directory
.TP
trellis\-changelog(1)
Changelog fragment management (see [tools.trellis.changelog])
.TP
trellis\-version(1)
Plan and apply version bumps from unreleased changelog fragments
.TP
trellis\-init(1)
Bootstrap a workspace: write a [tools.trellis] table at the repo root
.TP
trellis\-new(1)
Scaffold a new workspace member
.TP
trellis\-release(1)
Release orchestration
.TP
trellis\-tag(1)
Compare package versions against git tags; create what\*(Aqs missing
.TP
trellis\-publish(1)
Publish packages to Hex, in dependency order, with path deps rewritten
.TP
trellis\-lockfile(1)
Lockfile maintenance
.TP
trellis\-doctor(1)
Validate workspace invariants; non\-zero exit on any error
.TP
trellis\-ci(1)
Structured output for CI
.TP
trellis\-completions(1)
Print the shell snippet that enables tab\-completion
